1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,542
Teacher midterm practice, question 33.

2
00:00:04,162 --> 00:00:07,323
True or false: etching is used only to reveal

3
00:00:07,323 --> 00:00:10,484
the microstructure of amorphous materials.

4
00:00:12,185 --> 00:00:14,816
Etching attacks a polished metal unevenly.

5
00:00:14,816 --> 00:00:18,305
Grain boundaries, and grains with different orientations,

6
00:00:18,305 --> 00:00:21,741
etch at different rates, and that reveals the grains.

7
00:00:22,361 --> 00:00:25,425
An amorphous material has no grains to reveal.

8
00:00:25,425 --> 00:00:30,282
Etching is the standard way to see the grain structure of crystalline metals.

9
00:00:31,882 --> 00:00:33,778
So the answer is B: false.

10
00:00:34,597 --> 00:00:37,368
The single word amorphous makes the statement false.
